WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone,
whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases.
I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel,
Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 5]

01:51.300 --> 01:52.900
Haven't congratulated you yet,

01:53.100 --> 01:53.780
Grand Mentor.

01:54.580 --> 01:55.820
Come on, Wangyou.

01:55.820 --> 01:56.460
[Wangyou]

01:56.460 --> 01:57.380
Since when did you learn

01:57.420 --> 01:58.500
to tease people?

01:59.460 --> 02:00.940
I feel happy for you.

02:01.620 --> 02:02.740
After all these years,

02:02.900 --> 02:04.020
you've finally made it.

02:05.260 --> 02:06.060
But anyway,

02:06.500 --> 02:07.500
are you not worried?

02:08.580 --> 02:09.660
Chu Zhao...

02:10.540 --> 02:11.740
What do you know about her

02:11.980 --> 02:13.100
that makes you help her?

02:13.540 --> 02:14.500
You even abandon

02:14.540 --> 02:15.660
the alliance with Xiao Xun.

02:16.340 --> 02:17.780
I'm not helping Chu Zhao.

02:18.540 --> 02:19.300
I'm securing

02:20.060 --> 02:21.980
my own bright future.

02:22.500 --> 02:24.500
Be careful, it may backfire.

02:25.340 --> 02:27.300
The easier a game seems,

02:27.820 --> 02:29.140
the more hidden threats there are.

02:30.020 --> 02:31.060
We learned this

02:31.100 --> 02:32.020
when we were young.

02:32.700 --> 02:33.140
It won't.

02:35.180 --> 02:36.740
Because I always have a way out.

02:38.020 --> 02:39.340
She knew Xiao Xun

02:39.380 --> 02:40.700
would poison the young emperor.

02:41.340 --> 02:42.700
In that case,

02:43.020 --> 02:44.380
she still used him as bait

02:45.900 --> 02:47.140
just to get rid of Xiao Xun.

02:48.340 --> 02:49.940
That was a risky move.

02:50.340 --> 02:52.060
Fight to survive, fight to win.

02:52.900 --> 02:54.580
I don't care who the Emperor is.

02:55.980 --> 02:57.420
As long as I retain

02:59.860 --> 03:00.860
my high standing.

03:04.700 --> 03:05.340
I lost.

03:06.660 --> 03:07.100
Mr. Deng,

03:07.300 --> 03:08.500
Old Madam invited you to dine.

03:21.420 --> 03:22.060
I got it.

03:38.700 --> 03:39.540
I'm sorry.

03:41.740 --> 03:43.060
I shouldn't have used you as bait.

03:45.380 --> 03:46.660
I swore to the late emperor

03:46.740 --> 03:47.580
I'd keep you safe.

03:50.020 --> 03:51.780
But I put you in danger.

03:53.620 --> 03:54.940
I don't deserve to be your sister.

03:56.860 --> 03:58.220
Zhao, don't say that.

03:59.220 --> 04:00.420
That was our plan.

04:01.100 --> 04:01.580
Look.

04:02.100 --> 04:03.260
I'm all right now.

04:04.660 --> 04:05.900
Don't be sad, Zhao.

04:06.700 --> 04:07.700
My mother said

04:08.220 --> 04:09.780
a handwoven Longevity Thread

04:10.020 --> 04:10.980
embodied sincerity.

04:11.540 --> 04:12.500
Every knot

04:12.700 --> 04:13.820
would bind good luck.

04:14.340 --> 04:15.140
You made this for me

04:15.180 --> 04:16.140
by yourself.

04:16.740 --> 04:17.540
I'm quite happy.

04:20.540 --> 04:21.380
What do you think

04:21.780 --> 04:23.380
if I pair it with a jade pendant?

04:23.980 --> 04:24.900
Or a gold lock.

04:25.500 --> 04:26.540
It would look more regal.

04:30.940 --> 04:31.580
I'm sorry.

04:33.300 --> 04:33.860
I'm truly sorry.

04:38.340 --> 04:39.780
Don't say sorry to me.

04:40.420 --> 04:41.220
We came up with the plan together

04:41.260 --> 04:42.860
to catch the villain.

04:43.500 --> 04:45.220
Sadly, it turned out to be Uncle Xun.

04:46.060 --> 04:47.380
But I protected you.

04:48.100 --> 04:49.180
I'm really happy about that.

05:03.020 --> 05:03.300
Uncle,

05:03.340 --> 05:04.540
what food have you brought?

05:14.900 --> 05:15.540
Feed me.

05:21.300 --> 05:22.220
What a hassle.

05:31.700 --> 05:32.740
You're not feeding a horse.

05:33.060 --> 05:34.300
It's how soldiers feed people.

05:34.700 --> 05:35.900
You're getting back at me.

05:35.900 --> 05:37.060
You're slandering me.

05:40.020 --> 05:40.940
I won't bring you food anymore.

05:51.660 --> 05:52.580
Aren't you on duty?

05:53.100 --> 05:54.180
How do you have time

05:54.500 --> 05:55.620
to bring food to Yu?

06:01.980 --> 06:02.500
My cloak.

06:02.900 --> 06:03.380
Return it.

06:06.740 --> 06:08.020
You don't like it, do you?

06:09.140 --> 06:10.260
Why do you want it back now?

06:11.300 --> 06:12.900
I intended to give it to someone else.

06:28.700 --> 06:29.740
I lent that to you.

06:30.580 --> 06:31.340
After you use it,

06:32.820 --> 06:33.580
you give it back.

07:05.300 --> 07:05.820
Take it then.

07:12.500 --> 07:12.900
Uncle,

07:13.300 --> 07:14.260
what are you snatching?

07:14.580 --> 07:15.380
I wasn't snatching.

07:16.340 --> 07:16.900
I got back

07:16.940 --> 07:17.740
my own cloak.

07:21.700 --> 07:22.180
Zhao,

07:22.700 --> 07:23.580
do you remember

07:23.780 --> 07:24.460
your promise?

07:33.860 --> 07:34.380
Pretty, huh?

07:35.500 --> 07:36.300
Like falling petals.

07:37.540 --> 07:37.860
Here.

07:38.220 --> 07:38.660
Blow again.

07:39.660 --> 07:40.820
You promised him this.

07:41.220 --> 07:42.140
Why do I have to do it?

07:45.380 --> 07:46.780
I order you to do this for me.

08:05.460 --> 08:06.980
Is this swing sturdy enough?

08:07.460 --> 08:08.980
It can hold both of us, right?

08:09.340 --> 08:10.660
I won't play on this with you.

08:11.060 --> 08:12.060
Why?

08:12.540 --> 08:13.780
Swinging is so much fun.

08:14.500 --> 08:15.980
It lets us see distant views.

08:16.420 --> 08:17.140
Oh, boy.

08:17.460 --> 08:19.180
You can go outside and see the views.

08:19.740 --> 08:20.980
Why must you ride a swing?

08:22.780 --> 08:24.060
Can I really go outside?

08:32.940 --> 08:33.420
Come over.

08:34.140 --> 08:35.540
Falling petals!

08:46.340 --> 08:47.380
If you tie like this,

08:48.020 --> 08:48.820
when you finish,

08:49.420 --> 08:50.220
you'll sit on it

08:50.380 --> 08:51.220
and fall.

08:51.820 --> 08:53.060
I'm making a tight knot.

08:53.820 --> 08:54.780
How could we fall?

08:55.380 --> 08:56.060
You can fall.

08:57.380 --> 08:58.340
But if he falls,

08:59.340 --> 09:00.220
it would be big trouble.

09:01.420 --> 09:02.660
Don't underestimate me.

09:28.740 --> 09:30.020
Your Highness, you just

09:31.180 --> 09:31.980
wouldn't believe me

09:32.900 --> 09:33.580
until you fell.

09:36.660 --> 09:37.580
How did this happen?

09:38.580 --> 09:40.100
I'm sure I tied a tight knot.

09:43.100 --> 09:43.980
Zhao,

09:44.540 --> 09:46.100
do you really know how to make a swing?

09:52.660 --> 09:53.260
We soldiers

09:53.420 --> 09:53.980
use this knot

09:53.980 --> 09:55.060
to tie up prisoners.

09:55.620 --> 09:56.540
Once tied,

09:57.340 --> 09:58.260
no one can break free,

09:59.100 --> 09:59.660
whoever he is.

10:06.020 --> 10:06.340
Come on.

10:06.980 --> 10:07.580
I dare not.

10:09.500 --> 10:10.180
You do it, Zhao.

10:59.500 --> 11:00.460
Zhao.

11:02.260 --> 11:06.380
Let Uncle Xun go back to Xiaonan.

11:07.260 --> 11:07.740
Yu,

11:08.380 --> 11:09.100
what did you say?

11:10.220 --> 11:12.780
Stop fighting him.

11:20.780 --> 11:21.580
He's right.

11:22.620 --> 11:23.860
The Lord of Xiaonan still holds power.

11:25.220 --> 11:26.340
Xiao Xun is hard to deal with.

11:27.260 --> 11:28.660
If he remains in the Capital

11:29.260 --> 11:29.860
and fights you,

11:30.900 --> 11:32.380
you'll both suffer.

11:32.620 --> 11:33.900
This time, he escaped by luck.

11:34.780 --> 11:35.780
Next time, he won't.

11:36.860 --> 11:38.220
I know Xiao Xun has wild ambitions.

11:40.260 --> 11:41.500
But what on earth did he do

11:42.340 --> 11:43.300
that made you hate him?

11:44.100 --> 11:44.740
He went in person

11:44.740 --> 11:45.740
to Yunzhong to propose.

11:46.260 --> 11:46.980
I thought he cared

11:47.660 --> 11:48.300
about you.

11:52.260 --> 11:53.100
You...

11:54.220 --> 11:55.460
You loved each other, didn't you?

11:57.340 --> 11:58.340
Loved each other?

12:01.740 --> 12:02.500
That's the stupidest thing

12:02.540 --> 12:03.660
I've ever done.

12:05.140 --> 12:06.100
Even thinking of it

12:07.460 --> 12:08.540
makes me sick now.

12:17.460 --> 12:18.460
What have you been through?

12:30.780 --> 12:31.300
Jiu,

12:33.380 --> 12:34.260
do you believe

12:36.100 --> 12:37.780
one can live a second life?

12:42.820 --> 12:43.860
In my past life,

12:45.740 --> 12:47.260
I married Xiao Xun as I wished

12:48.580 --> 12:49.580
and became the Empress.

12:52.100 --> 12:53.300
Yet because of this,

12:53.300 --> 12:54.580
I got my father killed.

12:54.860 --> 12:56.060
So was my entire clan.

12:57.900 --> 13:00.060
I was also strangled by Xiao Xun.

13:08.860 --> 13:10.460
You think that's funny, don't you?

13:13.260 --> 13:13.900
Just pretend

13:14.740 --> 13:16.100
it was a dream I had.

13:17.820 --> 13:18.220
No.

13:25.500 --> 13:26.420
Everything

13:27.860 --> 13:29.020
exists for a reason.

13:31.380 --> 13:32.340
My father told me

13:33.220 --> 13:33.940
that people must

13:33.980 --> 13:35.700
bear the consequences of their choices.

13:37.700 --> 13:38.460
Just no regrets.

13:43.340 --> 13:43.940
But this time,

13:46.300 --> 13:47.540
you laid a trap for Xiao Xun.

13:48.980 --> 13:50.020
He suffered a quiet defeat.

13:51.500 --> 13:52.540
Once he's on guard,

13:53.380 --> 13:54.220
killing him

13:54.900 --> 13:55.580
won't be easy.

13:58.660 --> 14:01.860
He escaped by luck once.

14:04.020 --> 14:05.260
I won't give him another chance.

14:08.500 --> 14:09.620
Then, do you have a plan?

14:13.740 --> 14:14.660
If I do,

14:15.500 --> 14:16.340
will you help me?

14:33.400 --> 14:37.100
♪Broken walls and withered branches,
trapped in the mire♪

14:37.100 --> 14:38.460
- Hit him! - Hit him!

14:38.460 --> 14:40.640
♪Yet still striving
to reach for the sky♪

14:41.080 --> 14:45.040
♪My pride is torn down
and my body is sacrificed♪

14:46.920 --> 14:49.360
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

14:49.520 --> 14:50.960
♪And roars in the blaze♪

14:51.260 --> 14:54.440
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

14:54.880 --> 14:56.840
♪Fate imprisons me♪

14:57.080 --> 15:01.840
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

15:02.020 --> 15:04.160
♪Even if hope is faint♪

15:04.320 --> 15:06.100
♪I remain proud♪

15:06.360 --> 15:10.240
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

15:10.530 --> 15:12.200
♪However it ends up♪

15:12.520 --> 15:15.800
♪I'll go my own way♪

15:16.060 --> 15:17.780
♪With no fear of the distance♪

15:17.780 --> 15:18.620
If I do,

15:19.460 --> 15:20.300
will you help me?

15:20.300 --> 15:21.620
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

15:21.960 --> 15:25.060
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

15:25.060 --> 15:25.540
I will.

15:26.200 --> 15:31.120
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

15:31.600 --> 15:35.240
♪My new pride♪

15:36.180 --> 15:37.740
The sacrifice at the Ancestral Temple​

15:38.300 --> 15:39.300
has concluded.

15:39.980 --> 15:41.020
The accused were executed.

15:41.540 --> 15:44.100
The imperial city
has been thoroughly purged.

15:44.740 --> 15:46.580
Everyone should learn from this

15:47.260 --> 15:49.340
and never make mistakes.

15:52.340 --> 15:52.780
Oh.

15:53.420 --> 15:54.500
I've been thinking.

15:55.380 --> 15:57.340
Uncle Xun has been
a hostage for seven years.

15:57.900 --> 15:58.700
How pitiful.

15:59.940 --> 16:00.580
Shall we

16:01.100 --> 16:02.500
let him go back to Xiaonan?

16:03.540 --> 16:05.380
What do you think?

16:09.380 --> 16:10.140
Your Majesty,

16:10.540 --> 16:11.420
this is inappropriate.

16:11.900 --> 16:13.140
I'm sure all the ministers

16:13.580 --> 16:14.780
have doubts.

16:15.060 --> 16:17.100
Mr. Xie, you claimed

16:17.140 --> 16:18.260
that His Majesty was wise.

16:18.820 --> 16:20.180
But now you're questioning

16:20.220 --> 16:21.380
His Majesty's decision.

16:21.660 --> 16:22.940
That's not right, Mr. Deng.

16:23.860 --> 16:25.060
I've thought about it.

16:25.900 --> 16:27.140
Keeping Mr. Xiao as a hostage

16:27.580 --> 16:28.900
was the late emperor's last wish.

16:29.260 --> 16:31.380
And keeping him in the Capital

16:31.900 --> 16:33.340
can restrain his father.

16:33.900 --> 16:35.060
If we let him go,

16:35.900 --> 16:37.060
changes may occur.

16:37.860 --> 16:39.500
It makes sense, Mr. Xie.

16:39.860 --> 16:42.260
But Xiao Xun has endured a lot here.

16:42.780 --> 16:44.500
If any of that

16:44.500 --> 16:45.500
displeases his father,

16:45.820 --> 16:48.220
it'll threaten the court's stability.

16:55.940 --> 16:56.940
Your Highness,

16:57.500 --> 16:58.260
what do you think?

16:59.700 --> 17:01.700
Am I entitled to participate in this?

17:02.140 --> 17:03.460
By the late emperor's edict,

17:04.100 --> 17:06.340
the Grand Princess and Grand Mentor
oversee the court.

17:07.260 --> 17:08.100
So you are entitled.

17:09.580 --> 17:10.140
Your Majesty,

17:10.940 --> 17:11.740
and ministers...

17:12.940 --> 17:14.020
I've received

17:14.740 --> 17:16.620
a secret report
about the Northern Desert.

17:20.460 --> 17:21.860
I didn't mean to stir up trouble.

17:22.340 --> 17:23.660
But since Mr. Xie asked,

17:23.820 --> 17:25.220
I will be frank.

17:26.860 --> 17:29.180
Unusual movements have frequently
occurred on the frontier.

17:29.740 --> 17:31.380
Enemy troops seem to be massing.

17:32.300 --> 17:33.140
In the Capital,

17:33.740 --> 17:34.700
suspicious incidents

17:34.780 --> 17:36.100
have also occurred.

17:36.940 --> 17:37.460
Everywhere,

17:37.540 --> 17:39.020
unidentified figures are roaming.

17:39.660 --> 17:40.700
They gather in secret

17:41.060 --> 17:42.140
and behave suspiciously.

17:46.580 --> 17:47.220
Your Highness,

17:48.180 --> 17:49.780
can I read this report?

17:50.660 --> 17:51.220
No.

17:52.980 --> 17:54.180
This is a serious matter.

17:55.220 --> 17:56.780
I need to verify

17:56.820 --> 17:58.060
the authenticity of this report.

17:58.380 --> 17:59.780
Or innocent people may be involved.

18:00.020 --> 18:01.380
If this report is true,

18:02.300 --> 18:03.660
what should we do?

18:04.620 --> 18:06.100
Then the heir to the Lord of Xiaonan

18:06.740 --> 18:08.380
must not leave the Capital.

18:10.220 --> 18:12.300
Xiaonan Prefecture is adjacent
to the Northern Desert.

18:12.860 --> 18:14.580
If they collude with each other...

18:16.620 --> 18:17.780
The Lord of Xiaonan didn't

18:18.140 --> 18:20.700
come to His Majesty's coronation.

18:21.300 --> 18:24.180
It's hard to say
if he's been disloyal all along.

18:33.540 --> 18:36.340
[Two hours ago]

18:36.340 --> 18:36.900
Your Highness,

18:37.580 --> 18:39.500
the Pine Soot Ink
is exclusive to the Xie Family.

18:40.020 --> 18:41.060
You deliberately used it

18:41.100 --> 18:41.980
in this report.

18:42.620 --> 18:44.380
What if the Xie Family

18:45.020 --> 18:45.940
finds out?

18:46.780 --> 18:47.980
That's exactly what I want.

18:49.500 --> 18:50.460
If we release Xiao Xun,

18:50.860 --> 18:52.180
we'll be releasing an enemy.

18:53.020 --> 18:54.660
We'll lose all control over Xiaonan.

18:54.860 --> 18:55.700
Once trouble arises,

18:56.060 --> 18:57.100
Gaoyang will be affected.

18:57.540 --> 18:59.220
Xie Yanfang is the head of his clan.

18:59.420 --> 19:01.060
He wouldn't allow this to happen.

19:01.900 --> 19:02.460
Therefore,

19:02.940 --> 19:03.780
he'll prevent it.

19:05.180 --> 19:07.260
With the Pine Soot Ink from his clan,

19:09.220 --> 19:10.300
in this matter,

19:11.100 --> 19:12.740
he's fully bound

19:12.980 --> 19:14.020
to me.

19:14.620 --> 19:16.060
I don't quite understand.

19:16.820 --> 19:18.580
Why is Mr. Deng so eager

19:18.580 --> 19:19.500
to have Mr. Xiao leave?

19:20.260 --> 19:21.340
Isn't he supposed

19:22.180 --> 19:23.780
to speak in your favor?

19:25.900 --> 19:27.460
Court struggles have been like this.

19:28.700 --> 19:29.860
No permanent enemies.

19:30.420 --> 19:31.740
No permanent allies.

19:32.540 --> 19:33.540
That's why

19:34.060 --> 19:35.260
I must drag the Xie Family in.

19:37.220 --> 19:38.380
Because only an accomplice

19:38.660 --> 19:40.220
will desperately keep a secret.

19:41.140 --> 19:42.220
Even if this secret report

19:43.100 --> 19:44.260
turns out to be false,

19:45.740 --> 19:47.100
it has to be true.

20:24.020 --> 20:25.020
I haven't mastered

20:25.060 --> 20:26.100
this move.

20:27.020 --> 20:28.300
I'll practice more.

20:31.460 --> 20:33.060
Living inside the palace,

20:34.420 --> 20:35.940
you got news bout the Northern Desert.

20:37.500 --> 20:38.340
You really have

20:39.460 --> 20:40.540
good sources of information.

20:40.660 --> 20:42.340
You weren't in the court,

20:43.020 --> 20:45.100
but knew what happened there.

20:46.220 --> 20:47.700
You're actually well-informed.

20:59.260 --> 21:00.500
You want to drag the Xie Family in.

21:02.700 --> 21:04.060
Do you know how dangerous

21:04.540 --> 21:05.220
it could be?

21:09.540 --> 21:10.060
Chu Zhao,

21:11.780 --> 21:12.460
no one can

21:12.500 --> 21:13.540
play petty tricks

21:13.540 --> 21:14.300
under Xie Yanfang's nose.

21:15.700 --> 21:16.500
You're no exception.

21:17.260 --> 21:18.660
I want to be an exception.

21:21.700 --> 21:22.900
If he exposes

21:22.940 --> 21:24.060
that you forged the secret report

21:25.220 --> 21:26.420
and framed Xie Family,

21:27.900 --> 21:29.020
what will you do?

21:29.980 --> 21:30.460
Still wait

21:30.500 --> 21:31.260
until the young kid

21:31.260 --> 21:32.060
saves you again?

21:32.660 --> 21:33.660
Then I'll say

21:35.420 --> 21:36.500
you gave me that ink.

21:37.740 --> 21:38.940
Let's see if Xie Yanfang

21:40.020 --> 21:41.580
will abandon his brother.

21:48.740 --> 21:49.540
No one can

21:49.540 --> 21:50.420
read his mind.

21:51.060 --> 21:51.580
Jiu,

21:53.780 --> 21:54.620
you will help me,

21:55.580 --> 21:56.020
right?

21:59.700 --> 22:01.100
You fought on the frontier for years.

22:02.020 --> 22:02.860
You must know

22:03.220 --> 22:04.820
the looks and dressing habits

22:05.420 --> 22:06.460
of Northern Desert soldiers.

22:08.340 --> 22:09.180
Can you tell me?

22:10.660 --> 22:11.380
So,

22:12.580 --> 22:13.660
you've had a plan.

22:15.660 --> 22:17.940
What a perfect bait.

22:18.580 --> 22:19.740
She faked a secret report

22:20.060 --> 22:21.620
to confine Xiao Xun in the Capital.

22:22.020 --> 22:23.220
Xiao Xun is so suspicious

22:23.500 --> 22:25.540
that he'll take this for a trap.

22:26.180 --> 22:27.940
Then he'll speed up his escape plan.

22:28.580 --> 22:30.060
The spies I sent out

22:30.060 --> 22:30.860
told me

22:31.740 --> 22:32.900
Chu Zhao arranged some men

22:32.940 --> 22:34.700
to secretly bury weapons along the way

22:34.740 --> 22:35.500
to Xiaonan.

22:35.820 --> 22:37.380
When Xiao Xun reaches the border area,

22:38.540 --> 22:40.220
fake Northern Desert soldiers

22:40.260 --> 22:40.980
will get him.

22:41.300 --> 22:42.500
Once Xiao Xun escapes,

22:42.940 --> 22:44.660
he'll be shot dead immediately

22:44.980 --> 22:46.100
in the name of collusion

22:46.180 --> 22:47.020
and armed treason.

22:48.260 --> 22:48.820
Grand Mentor,

22:50.220 --> 22:51.580
once Xiao Xun dies,

22:52.180 --> 22:53.540
you'll have no way out.

23:01.740 --> 23:02.980
I have my own plans.

23:05.740 --> 23:07.020
If Xiao Xun escapes the Capital,

23:07.780 --> 23:08.700
I'll have rumors spread

23:09.460 --> 23:10.980
that the heir to the Lord of Xiaonan

23:11.700 --> 23:13.380
led Northern Desert soldiers in.

23:14.180 --> 23:15.540
He'll be seen as a traitor

23:17.020 --> 23:18.020
and killed on sight.

23:19.460 --> 23:20.860
If no obstacles arise...

23:20.900 --> 23:21.660
No obstacles.

23:23.060 --> 23:23.740
If there are,

23:25.180 --> 23:26.140
I'll destroy them.

23:28.060 --> 23:29.820
A forgery woven from truth

23:30.260 --> 23:31.860
is the hardest to disprove.

23:32.500 --> 23:34.260
As someone reborn, I know it better

23:34.420 --> 23:35.140
than anyone else.

23:36.020 --> 23:37.340
The Lord of Xiaonan and his heir

23:37.900 --> 23:39.500
do collude with Northern Desert foes.

23:44.900 --> 23:45.340
Your Highness.

23:47.500 --> 23:47.900
Any news?

23:48.980 --> 23:50.060
Chu Zhao did receive a report

23:50.300 --> 23:51.460
about you and your father

23:51.740 --> 23:53.100
raising troops and colluding with foes.

23:55.780 --> 23:57.300
How does she know

23:57.300 --> 23:57.980
all these things?

23:58.980 --> 24:00.020
Over the past years,

24:00.660 --> 24:01.900
I've stayed vigilant!

24:02.780 --> 24:03.940
There's no way she could

24:03.980 --> 24:05.220
know about the collusion thing.

24:06.100 --> 24:07.020
This woman is cunning.

24:07.500 --> 24:08.300
She must blind you

24:08.300 --> 24:09.020
with a pretense

24:09.580 --> 24:10.540
and let down your guard.

24:13.780 --> 24:14.620
No way.

24:17.500 --> 24:18.500
If I stay here,

24:20.420 --> 24:22.300
they can execute me

24:23.420 --> 24:24.220
in public

24:25.020 --> 24:26.020
with that secret report.

24:27.500 --> 24:28.300
But if I flee,

24:29.260 --> 24:30.820
I'll be convicted of treason

24:32.060 --> 24:32.940
and get killed there.

24:33.580 --> 24:35.900
Whatever choice we make,

24:36.940 --> 24:37.580
she will

24:38.500 --> 24:39.260
firmly

24:39.260 --> 24:40.700
hold the initiative.

24:41.460 --> 24:42.540
After years of planning,

24:43.180 --> 24:44.380
will we fall like this?

24:45.100 --> 24:46.020
That day in the court,

24:46.460 --> 24:47.620
we actually had the upper hand.

24:48.420 --> 24:49.620
How did things turn out like this?

24:50.260 --> 24:51.300
What exactly went wrong?

24:52.900 --> 24:54.060
What's gone is gone.

24:55.260 --> 24:56.100
Don't bring it up.

24:57.220 --> 24:57.820
But now,

24:59.260 --> 24:59.980
maybe we have

25:01.220 --> 25:03.100
a third option.

25:05.460 --> 25:06.460
Still haven't found her?

25:06.940 --> 25:07.660
Forgive us.

25:07.820 --> 25:09.580
We sent three teams on it.

25:09.620 --> 25:10.180
We found her.

25:10.660 --> 25:11.220
We did.

25:11.620 --> 25:12.820
Old Madam is back.

25:13.180 --> 25:13.980
The Grand Princess

25:13.980 --> 25:14.900
sent her back.

25:25.100 --> 25:25.540
Your Highness,

25:26.020 --> 25:26.340
my mother...

25:26.340 --> 25:27.420
She has been sent back

25:27.420 --> 25:28.260
to rest.

25:32.300 --> 25:33.700
I met your mother at the corner

25:34.220 --> 25:35.260
of the West Market.

25:36.180 --> 25:37.300
As I caught sight of her,

25:38.060 --> 25:39.500
she was picking up vegetable leaves

25:40.180 --> 25:41.180
from the ground.

25:46.020 --> 25:47.260
Born in the countryside,

25:48.100 --> 25:48.860
she's been frugal.

25:54.620 --> 25:55.580
Only those who starved

25:56.420 --> 25:58.100
would treasure every grain.

25:59.460 --> 26:01.220
Just like people all desire wealth.

26:02.820 --> 26:04.420
This is human nature.

26:10.980 --> 26:12.100
It's her personal preference.

26:12.860 --> 26:13.940
Please don't mock her.

26:15.140 --> 26:16.420
Why would I mock her?

26:18.260 --> 26:19.180
You truly have talent

26:19.940 --> 26:21.580
to rise to the Grand Mentor

26:22.660 --> 26:24.580
from a country boy.

26:25.300 --> 26:26.220
Your hard work is

26:26.700 --> 26:28.580
far beyond what others can imagine.

26:29.380 --> 26:30.380
Such diligence

26:31.900 --> 26:33.660
should be admirable.

26:38.940 --> 26:40.820
This is the braided Longevity Thread.

26:42.220 --> 26:43.260
Each knot

26:44.260 --> 26:45.580
can bind good luck.

26:46.620 --> 26:48.300
You didn't come here so late

26:48.980 --> 26:50.060
just to give me this,

26:50.060 --> 26:51.620
did you?

26:53.020 --> 26:53.900
I wonder if I can

26:53.900 --> 26:55.380
trade so much good luck

26:56.420 --> 26:58.220
for something from you.

26:59.940 --> 27:00.460
What is it?

27:01.340 --> 27:02.740
Xiao Xun's life.

27:10.860 --> 27:12.140
Are you so confident

27:12.620 --> 27:13.820
that you can kill him?

27:14.620 --> 27:15.060
Yes.

27:17.060 --> 27:18.260
So, Mr. Deng,

27:19.780 --> 27:21.140
please stay out of this.

27:25.500 --> 27:26.540
Once Xiao Xun dies,

27:27.340 --> 27:28.740
his treasures and forces

27:28.860 --> 27:30.100
he has gathered in the Capital

27:30.140 --> 27:30.900
all these years

27:32.300 --> 27:33.260
will be yours.

27:37.580 --> 27:38.820
Your Highness doesn't blame me

27:38.820 --> 27:39.660
for opposing you

27:39.660 --> 27:40.780
in court?

27:40.820 --> 27:41.220
I do.

27:42.260 --> 27:44.220
If you ruin my plan,

27:45.420 --> 27:46.580
I'll use these treasures

27:47.820 --> 27:49.500
to have you killed.

27:58.220 --> 27:59.220
Just kidding.

28:00.100 --> 28:01.020
Don't worry, Mr. Deng.

28:04.860 --> 28:07.180
So, you haven't told me

28:07.700 --> 28:08.780
your answer.

28:13.300 --> 28:14.340
It's easy to have wealth.

28:17.140 --> 28:18.580
But it's hard to have confidants.

28:22.060 --> 28:22.780
Deal.

28:23.700 --> 28:25.260
I always keep my word.

28:26.300 --> 28:27.340
So, Mr. Deng,

28:28.220 --> 28:29.580
hope you won't go back on yours.

28:32.820 --> 28:33.620
I won't.

28:38.660 --> 28:39.300
Your Highness,

28:39.420 --> 28:42.340
Mr. Xie has been waiting for you
for a long time on His Majesty's orders.

28:58.460 --> 28:59.300
Waiting for me?

29:05.500 --> 29:06.340
I'm just

29:08.420 --> 29:09.900
enjoying the moon.

29:12.860 --> 29:14.140
You're really in the mood.

29:14.700 --> 29:15.820
You enjoy the moon

29:16.060 --> 29:17.500
right in front of my palace.

29:19.700 --> 29:20.940
Were you worrying about me

29:20.940 --> 29:22.420
during my visit to Deng Yi's place?

29:23.540 --> 29:25.020
So, you've been waiting for me.

29:26.060 --> 29:27.340
In front of your Qiwu Palace,

29:28.460 --> 29:29.740
the moonlight is rather bleak.

29:32.260 --> 29:33.860
Bleak moonlight over a lonely minister.

29:34.620 --> 29:35.500
Perfect.

29:40.220 --> 29:41.540
Watch your step.

29:46.900 --> 29:47.820
I've been informed

29:48.900 --> 29:50.220
that Xiao Xun will leave tomorrow.

29:51.100 --> 29:52.020
How confident are you

29:52.660 --> 29:53.860
he'll take the official road

29:53.900 --> 29:54.500
as you planned?

29:55.260 --> 29:56.860
Tomorrow, I'll send naval forces

29:56.980 --> 29:58.300
to block all merchant ships

29:58.700 --> 30:00.020
in the name of inspecting smuggled salt.

30:01.660 --> 30:02.980
Once the dock is cut off,

30:03.860 --> 30:06.420
Xiao Xun will have to
take the official road.

30:25.380 --> 30:26.660
In that case,

30:28.140 --> 30:29.420
I've arranged crossbowmen

30:30.060 --> 30:30.900
at Woniu Ridge.

30:32.180 --> 30:34.620
Once Xiao Xun leaves the Capital,

30:35.980 --> 30:37.260
he'll be shot to death

30:37.980 --> 30:39.060
right there.

30:45.620 --> 30:48.780
Nothing shall go wrong tomorrow.

30:54.060 --> 30:54.660
Rest assured.

30:57.620 --> 30:59.100
Tomorrow, I'll lead the ambush myself.

31:02.180 --> 31:03.260
Nothing will go wrong.

31:06.050 --> 31:09.160
[Waterways of the State of Chu]

31:13.900 --> 31:14.900
Oh, Zhao.

31:15.900 --> 31:16.980
I don't know

31:17.020 --> 31:17.940
why you do this to me.

31:19.700 --> 31:20.740
But anyway,

31:22.060 --> 31:24.020
you've failed to trap me.

31:25.700 --> 31:26.260
Your Highness.

31:26.820 --> 31:27.260
Your Highness.

31:28.940 --> 31:30.300
Xiao Xun ran off with his men.

31:30.780 --> 31:31.620
By the official road?

31:31.900 --> 31:32.420
No.

31:33.220 --> 31:33.380
What?

31:34.420 --> 31:35.020
The whole dock

31:35.020 --> 31:36.260
is blocked by naval forces.

31:36.380 --> 31:37.300
To leave the Capital,

31:37.420 --> 31:38.380
that is his only option.

31:38.620 --> 31:39.060
How come?

31:39.260 --> 31:40.020
No trace of them

31:40.020 --> 31:41.300
was found on the official road.

31:41.620 --> 31:42.540
But our spies reported

31:42.860 --> 31:44.140
that a merchant ship sailed earlier

31:44.140 --> 31:45.020
at the third quarter of the Yin hour.

31:49.100 --> 31:49.940
We've been tricked.

31:52.260 --> 31:53.300
He escaped again.

31:53.780 --> 31:54.660
Mr. Xie already led his men

31:54.660 --> 31:55.420
to go after them.

32:18.300 --> 32:19.300
Xie Yanlai.

32:20.100 --> 32:21.020
I promised Her Highness

32:22.340 --> 32:23.500
that you wouldn't live.

32:24.220 --> 32:24.980
Are you sure

32:25.820 --> 32:27.100
Zhao wants me dead?

32:27.860 --> 32:29.380
She loved me so much.

32:30.060 --> 32:31.020
That was before.

32:33.580 --> 32:34.260
Now,

32:35.460 --> 32:36.420
she wants you dead.

32:37.660 --> 32:38.700
I forgot to ask you.

32:40.100 --> 32:41.220
The boy of the Wei Village

32:41.820 --> 32:43.300
who survived alone...

32:44.220 --> 32:44.820
Xiang.

32:45.860 --> 32:47.020
Did he take revenge on you?

32:52.460 --> 32:53.260
I'm Xiang.

32:53.460 --> 32:54.180
What's your name?

33:46.940 --> 33:47.660
Xiang,

33:49.460 --> 33:50.260
where are you?

33:52.700 --> 33:53.780
It was all my fault.

34:21.540 --> 34:23.260
Mr. Xie is seriously injured.

34:23.580 --> 34:25.180
Thankfully he was treated in time.

34:25.660 --> 34:27.420
I've bandaged his wound.

34:27.820 --> 34:29.020
I'll go make a prescription

34:29.700 --> 34:31.020
to bring down his fever.

34:31.820 --> 34:33.620
He lost too much blood.

34:34.180 --> 34:36.300
He must rest very well to recover.

34:50.740 --> 34:51.580
Your Highness,

34:52.420 --> 34:53.460
we got a tip.

34:54.220 --> 34:57.340
Xiao Xun has fled to Xiaonan.

35:02.780 --> 35:04.060
It will be even harder

35:05.300 --> 35:05.900
to kill him.

35:24.940 --> 35:26.460
I thought my plan was flawless.

35:28.180 --> 35:29.980
Yet I was one move short.

35:31.620 --> 35:33.220
Sorry to have dragged you into this.

35:36.420 --> 35:37.780
You used to say you owed me.

35:39.340 --> 35:40.020
Now,

35:42.820 --> 35:44.220
I owe you.

35:59.380 --> 36:00.260
Zhao.

36:11.100 --> 36:11.580
Your Highness.

36:30.340 --> 36:31.300
Have you found the man

36:31.940 --> 36:32.660
I asked for?

36:33.580 --> 36:34.060
It's Fang Du,

36:34.500 --> 36:35.380
a follower of Deng Yi.

36:36.380 --> 36:37.940
Last year, he became a Naval Commander.

36:38.460 --> 36:39.260
Xiao Xun's ship

36:39.500 --> 36:40.940
managed to leave the dock

36:41.020 --> 36:41.900
with his pass.

36:50.340 --> 36:52.660
What a duplicitous Deng Yi.

37:21.140 --> 37:22.780
Your Highness, why did you break in here

37:23.380 --> 37:24.700
so late at night?

37:27.620 --> 37:28.580
Mr. Deng,

37:29.420 --> 37:31.860
I'm here to give you a present.

37:32.700 --> 37:34.300
I've heard you like rare wood.

37:34.500 --> 37:35.900
The golden-thread nanmu

37:36.300 --> 37:37.660
is of noble grade.

37:38.580 --> 37:39.420
I wonder

37:40.100 --> 37:41.900
if you like it.

37:42.100 --> 37:43.260
No merit, no reward.

37:44.100 --> 37:44.980
I'm not worthy

37:46.860 --> 37:48.180
of this present.

37:49.100 --> 37:50.540
How could you not be worthy?

37:53.340 --> 37:54.500
You asked Fang Du

37:55.220 --> 37:56.540
to give that permission.

37:58.420 --> 38:00.460
You "helped" me really much.

38:01.220 --> 38:02.020
How could I

38:02.780 --> 38:04.540
not reward you?

38:06.940 --> 38:08.380
Buried underground,

38:08.420 --> 38:09.460
this wood will never rot.

38:10.140 --> 38:11.900
It's a perfect fit

38:12.340 --> 38:13.260
for your great merit.

38:15.460 --> 38:16.660
You must be kidding.

38:17.300 --> 38:18.060
Kidding?

38:19.060 --> 38:21.020
I'm being really serious

38:21.020 --> 38:22.420
to give you this reward.

38:24.500 --> 38:25.100
What?

38:25.940 --> 38:27.020
You don't like it?

38:27.900 --> 38:30.380
Or will you defy my order?

38:35.380 --> 38:36.220
I like it.

38:36.580 --> 38:37.860
In that case,

38:38.300 --> 38:39.460
keep it very well.

38:40.420 --> 38:41.460
Put it in the yard,

38:41.540 --> 38:43.100
so you can look at it every day.

38:43.220 --> 38:44.300
Without my order,

38:44.460 --> 38:45.300
it mustn't be removed.

38:49.660 --> 38:50.340
Your Highness,

38:51.500 --> 38:53.180
thank you for your reward.

38:53.940 --> 38:55.020
You're welcome, Mr. Deng.

38:55.860 --> 38:56.940
After all...

39:00.020 --> 39:01.220
We have a long way to go.

39:05.420 --> 39:06.020
If you think

39:06.020 --> 39:07.500
the Longevity Thread is too long,

39:08.180 --> 39:09.740
I can give you a shorter one.

39:29.700 --> 39:34.300
♪Broken walls and withered branches,
trapped in the mire♪

39:34.580 --> 39:37.060
♪Yet still striving
to reach for the sky♪

39:37.100 --> 39:41.140
♪My pride is torn down
and my body is sacrificed♪

39:43.380 --> 39:45.500
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

39:45.580 --> 39:47.540
♪And roars in the blaze♪

39:47.620 --> 39:50.860
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

39:51.020 --> 39:53.260
♪Fate imprisons me♪

39:53.420 --> 39:58.220
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

39:58.220 --> 40:02.420
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

40:02.420 --> 40:06.700
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

40:06.700 --> 40:12.140
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

40:12.140 --> 40:14.100
♪With no fear of the distance♪

40:14.100 --> 40:17.820
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

40:17.820 --> 40:22.260
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

40:22.260 --> 40:27.620
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

40:27.620 --> 40:31.220
♪My new pride♪

40:46.020 --> 40:48.920
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

40:48.920 --> 40:51.420
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

40:51.420 --> 40:53.790
♪Amidst the chaos♪

40:53.790 --> 40:58.060
♪I'll always be with you♪

40:59.500 --> 41:01.620
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

41:01.700 --> 41:03.660
♪And roars in the blaze♪

41:03.740 --> 41:06.980
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

41:07.140 --> 41:09.380
♪Fate imprisons me♪

41:09.540 --> 41:14.340
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

41:14.340 --> 41:18.540
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

41:18.540 --> 41:22.820
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

41:22.820 --> 41:28.260
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

41:28.260 --> 41:30.220
♪With no fear of the distance♪

41:30.220 --> 41:33.940
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

41:33.940 --> 41:38.380
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

41:38.380 --> 41:43.740
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

41:43.740 --> 41:47.340
♪My new pride♪
